> **Compilation of ALMA products with literature stellar masses; two UN-optimised gas tracers ([CII] and dust), class S/L bands; calibration-limited; NOT blind to the published kinematics of the ALPINE rotators (Jones+21) nor to Rizzo+20's SPT0418-47 curve (disclosed in the criteria); not a detection; not a verdict. ΛCDM has no a₀: the proxy is an effective-a₀ PROXY. κ = ½ is FITTED. No sentence of this lane says any law is separated, preferred or disfavoured, because the blind pre-flight (committed before any velocity was extracted) said it cannot be.**
